 "dbpsk_rules": "nodes = top 3 by energy increase after START TX (v4 rule 1); y = sum of (x - OFF baseline) / OFF sigma over them; timing: carrier-on and carrier-off edges (first / last |y| > 10 lead rms, midpoint to the neighbouring sample) give the start and the clock (n_symbols bits apart, clipped to +-200 ppm as v4); bit k = 1 if y(last guarded sample of symbol k-1) * y(first guarded sample of symbol k) < 0, guard 2 ms as v4, no guarded sample -> any sample of the symbol, none -> decided 0",
